{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里多了一层牵挂，越珍惜这份亲近，越在意它能否长久。亲近早已成了他能依靠的安稳，所以失去它的可能更让他心慌。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他对亲近的依恋进一步带上了对失去它的牵挂。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文已写明亲近成为他的安稳来源，依恋也不断加深，因此他对这份亲近能否延续的牵挂有直接的历史依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜里，他又感到一点寂寞：渴望本身的满足，仍填不满被真正理解的需要。长久少有被懂得的经验，让这份需要在亲近中格外真切。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"渴望本身的满足，并未消除他对真正理解的需要。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文既写过他从渴望本身得到满足，也写过被理解的需要长期少有着落，因此此刻的寂寞有明确的经历依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "540fcfa3-1c31-4767-8b0f-d9b242ae2b29", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T022332663540Z", "elapsed_seconds": 133.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:25:46.088917+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f14135c263259c86ba2ed13e9f4a8581bd59d28eddceadf63cc58ffc009f0125", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf8